flowchart TB
  MSG[Input message or stdin] -->|fi-fhir parse<br/>--format hl7v2 / csv / edi / cda| EVT[event JSON<br/>events + parse_warnings]
  PROF[Source Profile<br/>YAML] -.->|--profile| MSG
  CFG[Workflow config<br/>YAML + CEL] -.->|--config| RUN

  EVT --> RUN[fi-fhir workflow]

  RUN --> SUBRUN[run<br/>executes actions]
  RUN --> SUBDRY[dry-run<br/>shows matches only]
  RUN --> SUBSIM[simulate<br/>mock actions]

  SUBRUN --> OUT[Side effects<br/>log · webhook · fhir · email · exec<br/>file · database · queue · event_store]

  SERVE[fi-fhir serve] --> NOTE[GraphQL API + HTTP ingress<br/>+ MLLP + batch + delivery worker]
